---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us - Editorial Board & Systems Engineering" 
  description="Learn about Bijak Technology, an independent engineering publication covering cloud infrastructure, enterprise ERP, and real-world system architecture."
  lang="en"
  alternateId="/about/"
  alternateEn="/en/about/"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10 py-4">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center py-6 border-b border-slate-300/80 dark:border-slate-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 dark:text-white tracking-tight uppercase">
        About Bijak Technology
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2 font-mono">
        Independent Research Journal on Systems Architecture, Cloud VPS, &amp; Enterprise Engineering
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Overview -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
      <p class="first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:font-extrabold first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-3 first-letter:text-rose-600 font-medium">
        Bijak Technology was founded with a steadfast commitment to explore, evaluate, and implement rigorous software engineering paradigms. We view systems architecture not as abstract theory or corporate marketing buzzwords, but as empirical instruments for solving operational scalability, infrastructure resilience, and cost efficiency in real production environments.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        Through this independent publication platform, our engineering desk analyzes distributed system architectures, open-source Frappe &amp; ERPNext v16 implementations, containerized workloads, high-performance cloud VPS benchmarks, and corporate data sovereignty frameworks.
      </p>

      <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        Our contributors operate with an empirical, evidence-based ethos—validating technical hypotheses directly in production code, telemetry collectors, and automated deployment pipelines to deliver genuine, actionable value to CTOs, Lead Architects, and DevOps engineers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Leadership Profile (Privacy-Safe E-E-A-T) -->
    <div class="bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-300/80 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-900 to-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-extrabold text-2xl shadow-lg shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 fill-current text-white/90" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/60 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400">
            Editorial Board &amp; Systems Engineering Desk
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            Editorial Team &amp; Architecture Curators
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Curated by a collective of software architects, systems engineers, and infrastructure practitioners dedicated to clean code standards, private cloud data sovereignty, and modern computational efficiency. Every publication adheres to strict industrial fact-checking and reproducible benchmarks.
          </p>

          <!-- Ecosystem & Contact Links -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-3 pt-2 text-xs font-bold">
            <a 
              href="https://samkarsa.com" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-700 text-white hover:bg-rose-600 transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
              <span>Samkarsa Enterprise Solutions</span> &rarr;
            </a>
            <a 
              href="https://github.com/bijaktechnology" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
              <span>GitHub Repositories</span> &rarr;
            </a>
            <a 
              href="/en/contact/" 
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-rose-600 text-white hover:bg-rose-700 transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
              <span>Contact Editorial Desk</span> &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
